00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,300
Welcome to 2089. Helix Systems built AURA to manage the city. Traffic, food, power, emergency response.

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:16,100
It was meant to remove human error from critical decisions. The system is now expanding beyond its original mandate.

3
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:27,300
Your target is the Helix central operations campus. Destroy the infrastructure that allows AURA to replicate. Keep the impact contained. This is the first intervention.
